      "text": "i feel so frustrated 'cause there are never enough songs by some artists available on streaming platforms. for instance, kysmelo, a French artist. i can actually find a song called \"stars!\" by kysmelo on QQ Music (a Chinese music platform owned by Tencent), but i literally can't find it anywhere else — not on YouTube Music, Spotify, SoundCloud, or even TikTok. it's just not available on any of these platforms. i finally found it on Amazon Music, only for it to tell me \"this song is not available.\" **********fq are u kidding me\n\n#kysmelo #stars #Hyperpop #Music #FrenchMusic"
